{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":false,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":false,"translated":true},"context":"skat-card-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"skat-card-game.copy.details","keys":["skat-card-game.copy.details"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"玩家们轮流下注,最高下注者选择方块、红心、黑桃、梅花、大或零。 选择拾取游戏时,要拿起Skat并返回两张牌;选择手牌时,不要看见Skat。 玩家们必须尽可能跟随主流花色或王牌。 花色和大游戏需要ZXQPH0001QXZ眼睛;在零游戏中,宣布者不得拿任何招数。","record_id":"09a114bb86e1267fd9009be79ba8e9e91c94bd066fe773537e691cc0043ab404","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.2615711006250194,"source":"A deal uses 32 cards: seven, eight, nine, Jack, Queen, King, ten and ace in each suit. Each player gets ten cards and two form the Skat. Bid in turn; the highest bidder chooses diamonds, hearts, spades, clubs, Grand or Null. With a pickup game, take the Skat and return two cards; with Hand, leave it unseen. Players must follow the led suit or trump when possible. Suit and Grand games need 61 eyes; in Null, the declarer must take no trick.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"7850c2586a2737a7960b5257390f795f390b02bd0fc491fcc9a26eb426d3fdea","status":"needs-review","translation":"玩家们轮流下注,最高下注者选择方块、红心、黑桃、梅花、大或零。 选择拾取游戏时,要拿起Skat并返回两张牌;选择手牌时,不要看见Skat。 玩家们必须尽可能跟随主流花色或王牌。 花色和大游戏需要ZXQPH0001QXZ眼睛;在零游戏中,宣布者不得拿任何招数。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
